diff --git a/debian/patches/0098-allow-vaapi-import-of-alpha-10-bit-rgb-drm-formats.patch b/debian/patches/0098-allow-vaapi-import-of-alpha-10-bit-rgb-drm-formats.patch
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/debian/patches/0098-allow-vaapi-import-of-alpha-10-bit-rgb-drm-formats.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@
+Allow VAAPI to import the ALPHA spellings of the 10-bit RGB DRM formats.
+
+Vulkan exports a single-plane 10-bit RGB image as DRM_FORMAT_ARGB2101010 or
+DRM_FORMAT_ABGR2101010, never the X variants: hwcontext_vulkan.c's
+vkfmt_to_drmfmt() returns the first match in vulkan_drm_format_map and the alpha
+spellings are listed first. vaapi_drm_format_map carries only the X spellings,
+so mapping a Vulkan x2rgb10/x2bgr10 frame to VAAPI fails:
+
+    [AVHWFramesContext] DRM format not supported by VAAPI.
+    [Parsed_hwmap] Failed to map frame: -22.
+
+X and A differ only in whether the top two bits are meaningful; the layout is
+identical and the driver takes the surface either way.
+
+THE PAIRING IS CROSSED. The DRM and Vulkan tables are channel-inverted by
+convention -- DRM fourccs are little-endian packed while Vulkan PACK32 names
+read MSB-first -- so DRM_FORMAT_ARGB2101010 carries the Vulkan A2B10G10R10
+layout. Measured by logging desc->layers[0].format in vaapi_map_from_drm():
+
+    libplacebo format=x2rgb10  ->  DRM fourcc AB30 (ABGR2101010)
+    libplacebo format=x2bgr10  ->  DRM fourcc AR30 (ARGB2101010)
+
+so each alpha fourcc maps to the VA fourcc of the OPPOSITE channel order. The
+same-order pairing transposes R and B, and does it silently: a valid file at
+full speed with the chroma destroyed. Per-channel PSNR against the 8-bit bgra
+chain was y 29.12 / u 16.08 / v 17.22 crossed-wrong, y 51.53 / u 48.12 /
+v 48.23 correct.
+
+Order matters: the X entries stay AHEAD of these, because vaapi_map_to_drm()
+takes the first va_fourcc match and the export direction must keep emitting the
+X spellings. Do not reorder them.
+
+Full rationale, measurements and the diagnosis method:
+docs/patches/0003-vaapi-alpha-10bit-rgb.md in the build-recipe repo.
+
+Index: FFmpeg/libavutil/hwcontext_vaapi.c
+===================================================================
+--- FFmpeg.orig/libavutil/hwcontext_vaapi.c
++++ FFmpeg/libavutil/hwcontext_vaapi.c
+@@ -1078,6 +1078,12 @@ static const struct {
+ #if defined(VA_FOURCC_X2B10G10R10) && defined(DRM_FORMAT_XBGR2101010)
+     DRM_MAP(X2B10G10R10, 1, DRM_FORMAT_XBGR2101010),
+ #endif
++#if defined(VA_FOURCC_X2R10G10B10) && defined(DRM_FORMAT_ABGR2101010)
++    DRM_MAP(X2R10G10B10, 1, DRM_FORMAT_ABGR2101010),
++#endif
++#if defined(VA_FOURCC_X2B10G10R10) && defined(DRM_FORMAT_ARGB2101010)
++    DRM_MAP(X2B10G10R10, 1, DRM_FORMAT_ARGB2101010),
++#endif
+ };
+ #undef DRM_MAP
+ 
